# VALIDATION (against the new Nemotron-3.5-Lightning bundle, 358 concepts)
# ============================================================================
#   - all 65 qids exist in questions/questions.csv
#   - no duplicate qids; no flawed qid present
#   - every gold_concepts document for the 55 answerable qids resolves to >=1
