# ============================================================================
# HUMAN-LABEL BURDEN FOR v2
# ============================================================================
#   65 qids x 2 arms (chunk + okf) = 130 rows, ALL fresh.
#   The v1 human labels do NOT carry over: v2 runs on a different bundle
